  "criteria_exact": [
    "Implement canonical signing and verify every output under the selected identity using qualified libraries.",
    "Prove one-use consent and exact-review binding with negative tests; preserve independent Python/vector verification.",
    "Build the host engine and no_std compile/final-link probes for an initial embedded target without board-specific Nostr semantics or mandatory SE dependencies; other profile hardware does not gate this common milestone.",
    "Define bounded secret ownership across complete operations; avoid repeatedly copying keys across language/process adapters.",
    "Reject duplicate JSON members, trailing bytes, invalid Unicode and Nostr kind outside 0..65535; keep an independent NIP-01 oracle rather than only cross-language parity.",
    "Bound parse/review storage and work in the portable implementation, preserving independent edge-case vectors. Record available static size/build evidence; actual stack/peak RAM, parse/crypto latency, entropy and QR buffering are mandatory in each device implementation task before that profile releases."
  ],
